Error [E1004]: `process.argv` is not a Core member
  --> tests/ui/process_argv_removed.jet:4:22
    |
  4 |     words :: process.argv()
    |                      ^^^^
 Why: `process.args()` is the one list of the program's words, without the program name
 Fix: Use `process.args()` for the words and `sys.executable()` for the program path
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E1004
